codex
The two previously accepted corruptions now have exact clause spans and preserve their complete suffixes. Both quoted/raw node-name edge cases remain safely refusal-shaped, and three unterminated forms leave files unchanged. A deterministic 1,005-case stress probe spanning 0–6 hashes, embedded comment/brace/store decoys, newlines, semicolons, and partial closing delimiters also passed; I’m moving to the package suite and static gates.
